Peppy MMS PDU composer provenance
====================================

This package is a namespaced, directly traced Apache-2.0 adaptation of bounded
encoding routines from Android Open Source Project, packages/apps/Messaging,
commit
de315b762312dd1a5d2bbd16e62ef2bd123f61e5:
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/apps/Messaging/+/de315b762312dd1a5d2bbd16e62ef2bd123f61e5

That source is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Adapted routines:
PduComposer.java appendTextString (290-299), appendEncodedString (367-393),
appendValueLength (412-427), appendAddressType (462-470), makeSendReq
(514-572), and makeMessageBody (967-1091). PduHeaders/PduPart token values are
inlined only where necessary. The adaptation deliberately excludes all model,
persister, resolver, APN, and network code and uses public Java file APIs only.
